# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# APEX NEXT.JS PORTFOLIO TEMPLATE - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# To enable working email submissions via EmailJS (https://www.emailjs.com/):
# 1. Sign up for a free account at EmailJS.
# 2. Create an Email Service (e.g. Gmail / Outlook) and copy the Service ID.
# 3. Create an Email Template and copy the Template ID.
# 4. Copy your Public Key from Account > API Keys.
# 5. Rename this file to `.env.local` and paste your actual keys below.

NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_emailjs_service_id_here
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_emailjs_template_id_here
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key_here

